Personal test installs for Apoorv only — not App Store / Play Store release shipping.

When installing Fud AI on my real phones so I can test:

- **iOS**: Release build only. Install over the existing App Store / prior install. Never uninstall first.
- **Android**: Debug build only. Use `adb install -r` (or equivalent replace) over the existing install. Never uninstall first or clear app data.
- Preserve existing on-device data unless I explicitly ask to wipe or reinstall clean.
- Prefer the currently connected device (Apoorv’s iPhone / USB Android) when I ask to install without naming one.
- After promoting workout images, rebuild so Android assets are refreshed before install; verify a sample promoted frame is in the APK.
